        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon Fantasy: Fairies is the perfect puzzle game for a fun and rewarding pastime. Collect pictures, develop your attention, and feel like a part of the beautiful neon world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neon Fantasy: Fairies  is a puzzle game featuring beautiful fairies in a neon style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to assemble a picture of neon fairies that has been cut into an equal number of pieces. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features several levels of difficulty, allowing you to choose the optimal level for your experience and mood. Regardless of the difficulty, you can enjoy high-quality images of fairies in bright neon style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Neon Fantasy: Fairies: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >•50 levels<br>•Neon art<br>•Simple controls (mouse)<br>•Achievements<br>•Relaxing music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199340/extras/826ed75de2ec9ba030f425c716285b29.poster.avif?t=1777112589\" width=604 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199340/extras/826ed75de2ec9ba030f425c716285b29.webm?t=1777112589\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199340/extras/684d0c00d3fdb9e8c1d358c254a86857.avif?t=1777112589\" width=640 height=250 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4199340/extras/90863b3